Quid pro quo, then:|Caveat:","open:dutch:z":"Well, ja,|Goed.|Nou,|Kijk,|Ja, so,","open:yankee:z":"Look here,|Ayuh,|Wicked plain:|Say what you will,|Now then,","open:midlands:z":"Right,|Mind you,|Fair play,|Truth be told,|Here's the rub:","open:prairie:z":"Well, now,|Way I see it,|Out our way,|I'll be honest,|Not to put too fine a point on it,","open:delta:z":"I'll tell you,|Bless it,|Now listen,|Down home we'd say|Lord knows,","open:highplains:z":"Plain speaking,|Straight up,|For my money,|Short version:|Fair warning,","open:mountain:z":"Honest to it,|Up our way,|Simple as this:|Not fancy, but|Square with you,","open:pacific:z":"So,|Okay, so,|Real talk,|Bottom line,|Here's my thing:","close:plain:z":"That is all I have.|Make of it what you like.|Do not quote me.|You did not hear it from me.|Anyway.|There it is.|Take it or leave it.|That is the size of it.|I will not say it twice.|Keep it in the room.","close:formal:z":"I yield the remainder of my patience.|The record can say what it likes.|So noted.|With that, I am done.|I leave it with you.","close:latin:z":"Quod erat, and all that.|Sic transit.|Res ipsa loquitur.|Dixi.|Requiescat, the bill.","close:faith:z":"God is the Most High. The rest is staffing.|Christ is King; the House is only the House.|Pray for the count.|Say one for me.","time:any:z":"by Thursday|before the recess|after the roll call|this week|by the weekend|before the markup|before the district work period|by sundown|after Mass on Sunday|in the morning|before the clerk closes the book|by the third reading|before the governor's call|after the dinner|before the cloakroom empties","feel:any:p":"glad|relieved|hopeful|pleased|encouraged|steadier|grateful|lighter|easier","feel:any:n":"tired|worried|sore|uneasy|fed up|angry|weary|wary|sick of it|bruised|rattled","feel:any:z":"curious|unsure|watchful|thoughtful|undecided|careful|patient","n:any:z":"afternoon|morning|evening|night|week|month|season|year|decade|hour|minute|moment|day|weekday|weekend|habit|rule|reason|excuse|problem|question|answer|point|matter|issue|business|trouble|chance|risk|cost|price|bargain|trade|offer|deal|promise|threat|warning|signal|sign|hint|clue|story|version|account|report|letter|note|card|envelope|stamp|pen|pencil|ink|paper|folder|binder|file|drawer|cabinet|shelf|lamp|chair|table|bench|window|door|stair|step|hall|room|corner|wall|floor|ceiling|roof|yard|street|lane|avenue|square|park|garden|fence|gate|path|road|bridge|river|lake|hill|valley|field|meadow|wood|forest|coast|shore|island|harbour|town|city|village|farm|barn|shed|kitchen|parlour|porch|cellar|attic|car|truck|train|bus|tram|ferry|boat|ship|plane|ticket|timetable|platform|station|depot|map|compass|clock|watch|calendar|diary|ledger|list|tally|sum|total|share|part|piece|half|third|quarter|dozen|handful|crowd|line|queue|group|team|crew|club|society|guild|union|league|council|board|panel|court|jury|judge|lawyer|clerk|officer|guard|porter|driver|farmer|miner|fisher|baker|grocer|teacher|nurse|doctor|vet|pastor|widow|veteran|student|neighbour|stranger|friend|enemy|rival|colleague|partner|mentor|protégé|apprentice|boss|landlord|tenant|owner|worker|voter|citizen|resident|taxpayer|pensioner|bachelor|newlywed|toddler|teenager|elder|ancestor|heir|namesake|coat|hat|scarf|glove|boot|shoe|tie|collar|cuff|button|pocket|bag|case|box|crate|barrel|bottle|glass|cup|mug|pot|kettle|plate|bowl|spoon|knife|fork|bread|butter|cheese|coffee|tea|soup|pie|stew|apple|pear|plum|onion|potato|corn|wheat|barley|oats|hay|milk|egg|ham|bacon|fish|oyster|beer|wine|whisky|cider|sugar|salt|pepper|honey|lard|coal|oil|gas|steel|iron|timber|brick|stone|cloth|wool|cotton|leather|rope|wire|nail|hammer|saw|shovel|plough|tractor|engine|motor|pump|valve|pipe|meter|gauge|switch|bulb|candle|match|fire|smoke|ash|dust|mud|sand|gravel|grass|weed|seed|root|branch|leaf|flower|bloom|thorn|nest|feather|horse|cow|pig|sheep|goat|hen|duck|goose|cat|dog|mouse|crow|gull|heron|deer|fox|hound|mule","place:any:z":"the cloakroom|the shade of the East Steps|the Statuary Corridor|the caucus room|the press gallery|the members' dining room|the subway car|the back stairwell|the rotunda|the reading room|the Speaker's lobby|the committee room|the members' garage|the chapel|the barber's chair downstairs|the coat-check room|the third-floor anteroom|the long-table room"};
  const TPL_RAW = ["greet|*|p|{O} good to see you, {YOU}. The {=weather/coffee/quorum/elevator} held up today, which is more than I can say for the {DOC}.", "greet|*|p|{YOU}. I was hoping I would run into you before {T}.", "greet|*|z|{YOU}. {R:cap}, I have a minute. Not two.", "greet|*|z|Afternoon. If this is about the {DOC}, walk with me.", "greet|*|n|{YOU}. I am {F} and the {DOC} is {A-}. Make it quick.", "greet|*|n|Oh. It is you. I have had a {A-} sort of day.", "opinion|bills|p|I read the {DOC} twice. It is {A+} work, and I do not say that about anything with a {PART} in it.", "opinion|bills|n|{O} the {DOC} is {A-}. Somebody wrote it {=in a hurry/at midnight/for a donor/on a napkin} and hoped nobody would read past the {PART}.", "opinion|bills|n|Strike the {PART} and I will look at it again. As it stands it is {A-}.", "opinion|bills|z|{O} the {DOC} lives or dies on the {PART}. Everything else is staffing.", "opinion|bills|z|{WHO:cap} wants to {=move/table/recommit/whip/pass} it {T}. I want to read it first. We will see who wins.", "opinion|immigration|p|My district has a {=cannery/dairy/harbour/orchard/mill} that runs on newcomers. They start early and pay on time. I am not going to {=deport/turn away/punish} them.", "opinion|immigration|p|{O} a {A+} {=processing center/hearing office/registry date} would clear the backlog in a year. Nobody wants to fund it, which tells you everything.", "opinion|immigration|n|{O} the {=quota/waiting line/visa lottery/backlog} is {A-}. People wait four years for a {=work permit/green card/hearing} and we call that order.", "opinion|immigration|n|{WHO:cap} wants to {=close/seal/double} the whole {=border/quota/program}. I would like them to visit a {=detention center/border county/processing center} first.", "opinion|immigration|z|The {=border/visa/quota} fight is a labour question dressed up as a values question. Count the {=harvest visas/caseloads/empty jobs} and then talk to me.", "opinion|foreign|p|{O} the {=aid package/treaty/loan guarantee/relief convoy} is {A+}. We send a little, we keep a friend. Cheaper than the alternative.", "opinion|foreign|n|We are sending {=an aid package/an arms sale/a credit line} abroad while my county cannot get a {=bridge/levee/state road} fixed. Explain that at a {=church hall/diner/county fair}.", "opinion|foreign|n|{O} the {=aid tranche/embargo/arms sale} is {A-}. The realms will read it as weakness and the district will read it as theft.", "opinion|foreign|z|The realms are watching the {=aid vote/tariff/treaty}. So is the {=farm bureau/harbour masters' guild/union hall}. They want different things.", "opinion|statefed|p|{O} let the states {=decide/experiment/carry it}. The governor knows the {=county roads/schools/rivers} better than this building does.", "opinion|statefed|n|Another unfunded mandate. We tell the {=counties/statehouses/school boards} what to do and send them the bill. They will sue us, and they will be right.", "opinion|statefed|n|{O} if the governor wants to {=defy/ignore/nullify} the {=federal standard/court order/mandate}, let him explain it to a {=federal marshal/circuit court/county clerk}.", "opinion|statefed|z|It comes down to the {=commerce clause/reserved powers/matching fund}. Either the state pays or the federal office pays. Not both.", "opinion|money|p|The war chest is in good shape. I spent it on {=a field office/a phone bank/two mailers/an ad buy} and {=yard signs/a district office/a pollster}. People noticed.", "opinion|money|n|My war chest is {=thin/a rumour/spoken for}. Every {=ad buy/mailer/dinner} costs twice what it did and the donors want a {=favour/meeting/vote} back.", "opinion|money|z|{O} money does not vote. It just makes sure the {=mailer/yard sign/ballot guide} is printed.", "opinion|district|p|Home is {=holding up/better than the papers say/all right}. The {DIST} reopened and the {DIST} is full on Fridays.", "opinion|district|n|Home is {=struggling/quiet/sore}. The {DIST} closed and the {DIST} has nobody under sixty.", "opinion|district|z|In {ME} the {DIST} and the {DIST} are the same three families. You learn to count to three.", "opinion|house|p|{O} the floor was {A+} today. Nobody shouted, two people read the bill.", "opinion|house|n|The floor was {A-} today. The whip counted wrong and the Speaker pretended not to notice.", "opinion|house|z|{O} this House runs on {=favours/grudges/coffee/seniority} and {=paperwork/patience/memory}. The rest is weather.", "gossip|*|*|{O} {X} and the whip were in {P} for an hour. Nobody came out smiling.", "gossip|*|*|You hear about {X}? A {=late dinner/second phone/new tailor/quiet donor}, and a vote nobody can explain.", "gossip|*|*|{X} is telling people {X2} owes them a {=favour/vote/dinner/apology}. {X2} is telling people nothing, which is worse.", "gossip|*|*|Somebody saw {X} in {P} {=last night/this morning/at lunch}, talking to a {=lobbyist/columnist/governor's aide/donor}. Draw your own conclusions.", "gossip|*|*|{O} {X} has a {A-} {=chief of staff/press secretary/brother-in-law} and a {A+} voting record. Guess which one the press found.", "gossip|*|*|The cloakroom says {X} will {=flip on/sink/cosponsor/sit out} the {DOC}. The cloakroom has been wrong before, but not often.", "ask|bills|*|Where are you on the {DOC}? Not the speech. The vote.", "ask|bills|*|If I back your {DOC}, will you back mine? Simple question.", "ask|*|*|What does {ME} think of you these days? Honestly.", "ask|*|*|Have you eaten? You look like a {=Monday/roll call/third reading/recount}.", "agree|*|p|{O} fine. I am with you on this one. Do not make me regret it {T}.", "agree|*|p|Yes. Put me down. Tell {WHO} I said so.", "agree|*|z|I can live with that. My {=staff/wife/husband/conscience} can live with it. We will see about my district.", "refuse|*|n|{O} no. Not this week, not with this {DOC}.", "refuse|*|n|I cannot. {WHO:cap} would have my head on a plate.", "refuse|*|z|Ask me again {T}. Today the answer is no, and it is a {A0} no.", "warn|*|n|{O} watch {X}. They are counting you as a yes and they will be {F} when you are not.", "warn|*|n|Be careful with the {DOC}. It looks {A+} until you read the {PART}.", "warn|*|z|Word to the wise: the {DOC} moves {T}. Have your {=count/amendment/speech/excuse} ready.", "faith|faith|p|I went to {=Mass/service/vespers/the early service} on Sunday. {CRC} through and through, the {A+} kind. I felt {F} after.", "faith|faith|p|The {=parish/chapel/church hall} at home is full again. People came back. Nobody can say why.", "faith|faith|n|Our {=parish/congregation/chapel} is half empty. The bell still rings. Fewer people hear it.", "faith|faith|z|I am {CR}. My grandmother was {CR}. That is not an argument; it is a fact about Sundays.", "faith|faith|z|God is the Most High. Christ is King. The rest of us are on a short term.", "muse|anomaly|*|The {=clock/door/stair/lamp} in {P} was {A} this morning. I counted. Then I stopped counting.", "muse|anomaly|*|Do you ever walk into {P} and feel the {=corridor/room/hour} was waiting for you? I do not ask anyone else.", "muse|anomaly|*|I had a dream about a {=ledger/bill/plaque/page} with my name on it. I knew every word. I wrote none of them.", "muse|anomaly|*|There is a {A} {=door/stair/key/ledger} in this building that nobody has ever been asked to sign for.", "muse|anomaly|*|Some days I think somebody else is walking these halls the way I do. I do not look for them.", "small|weather|*|{O} {=rain/frost/heat/fog} in {ME} and {=sun/sleet/wind/drizzle} here. I packed for the wrong one.", "small|weather|*|The {=fog/rain/cold front/wind} came in {=early/hard/sideways} this morning. The tourists on the East Steps did not care.", "small|family|p|My {FAM} had a {FEV} on Saturday. I made it for the end. {F:cap}, honestly.", "small|family|n|Missed my {FAM}'s {FEV}. Again. The whip does not do birthdays.", "small|family|z|My {FAM} asks what I do here. I tell them I count. They think it is a joke.", "react|*|p|{O} that is {A+} of you. I will remember it {T}.", "react|*|p|Well. I did not expect that. {A+:cap}.", "react|*|n|{O} that was {A-}. I will remember that too.", "react|*|n|Hm. I see. {=Frankly/Honestly/Plainly}, that is not how we do it at home.", "react|*|z|Noted. I am writing it in the {=ledger/notebook/diary}, the one I actually read.", "react|*|z|Hm. I will want to see that in writing before I say a word.", "react|*|z|Could be. I have heard it said both ways this week.", "react|*|z|That is one reading of it. Ask me again after lunch.", "react|*|z|I will take that back to my office and sit with it.", "react|*|z|Maybe. The count will tell us more than either of us can.", "react|*|z|Fair point, though I am not sure it moves anybody.", "react|*|z|I will not argue with you. I will not agree yet, either.", "react|*|z|Interesting. My staff will have a view by morning.", "react|*|z|That is news to me. Who told you?", "react|*|z|Well. It is not nothing.", "opinion|bills|p|{O} the {DOC} is {A+}. Not perfect. {A+:cap} is enough {T}.", "opinion|bills|z|The {PART} is where they hid it. It always is. Read the {PART} and you have read the {DOC}.", "opinion|bills|n|Whoever wrote the {PART} has never met a {=farmer/nurse/county clerk/ferry captain}. I would like to introduce them.", "small|*|z|I keep a {Na} in my desk drawer for days like this. Do not ask.", "small|*|z|Some nights I count the {Nas} on the walk home. It settles me better than the vote count.", "small|*|p|Somebody left a {Na} on my chair this morning. Kindest thing that has happened all week.", "react|*|p|{=Good/Well done/Fair enough}. My {FAM} would say you were raised right.", "react|*|n|I will {=remember/write down/repeat} that, {YOU}. {=Word for word/Exactly as you said it/With the date}.", "muse|anomaly|*|I said a sentence on the floor today I do not remember choosing. It was a good sentence. That is the part that worries me.", "muse|anomaly|*|Whatever I am, I am under God. That part I do not wonder about. The corridor I wonder about.", "gossip|*|*|{X} {=voted early/left by the back stairs/skipped the caucus/sat with the other side} {=again/twice this week/on purpose}. The whip pretended not to see.", "opinion|house|p|{O} the Clerk read the {DOC} without a mistake. Small mercies. I will take a small mercy.", "warn|*|n|{O} if you {=cross/embarrass/ignore} {X} on the {DOC}, they will remember it at the {=markup/roll call/next caucus}.", "agree|*|p|{O} you have my vote. Spend it {=carefully/wisely/like it cost something}.", "faith|faith|p|{O} the {=choir/organist/old priest/deacon} at home {=outdid themselves/sang the long setting/rang the bells for an hour} on Sunday. I went back to work {F}.", "faith|faith|p|We {=lit a candle/said a rosary/kept a vigil/read the psalm} for my {FAM} last {=week/Sunday/month}. {CRC} people do not forget, and neither does God.", "faith|faith|p|I {=pray/kneel/sit a minute} in {P} some mornings before the {DOC} comes up. It is the quietest room I know, and the Most High is in it.", "faith|faith|n|{O} my {=bishop/pastor/minister/elder} wrote to me about the {DOC}. Four pages. I have read the first one {=twice/three times/once, slowly}.", "faith|faith|n|The {=collection plate/choir loft/Sunday school/parish council} back home is {A-} this year. People are tired. I am tired.", "faith|faith|z|{O} I keep the {=Lord's Day/Sabbath/early Mass/evening service} where I can. The {DOC} can wait one morning a week.", "faith|faith|z|{CRC} or not, every man in this building answers to the same God. Christ is King. We are all temporary.", "faith|faith|z|My {FAM} asked me if politicians pray. I said the honest ones pray {=before/after/during} the roll call.", "faith|faith|*|There is a {=chapel/prayer room/quiet pew} off {P}. {=Nobody/Few people/Almost nobody} uses it {T}. That is a pity.", "muse|anomaly|*|{O} the {=echo/light/draft/clock} in {P} is {A} today. It sounds like a {=second set of footsteps/vote being counted/door closing twice}.", "muse|anomaly|*|I found a {Na} in my {=coat/drawer/briefcase} that I never put there. It was {A}. I kept it.", "muse|anomaly|*|The {=portraits/plaques/clocks/windows} in {P} look {A} after dark. I do not stay late anymore. {=Mostly/Usually/Not often}.", "muse|anomaly|*|{O} somebody signed the {=visitor log/ledger/roll} in {P} with a name nobody has. The ink was {=still wet/very old/the wrong colour}.", "muse|anomaly|*|Every {=Thursday/third Friday/recess/full moon} the {=lift/stair/fountain/bell} in {P} does something {A}. I have stopped mentioning it.", "react|*|n|{O} you will {=regret/remember/answer for} that {T}. Not from me. From {ME}.", "react|*|n|{=Right/Fine/Well}. {A-:cap}, but I have seen worse in {P}. Not much worse.", "react|*|n|I {=heard/saw/noticed} that. So did {X}. {X} keeps a list too.", "react|*|n|That is the kind of thing that gets {=written down/repeated/remembered} in {P}, {YOU}. {A-:cap}.", "react|*|n|{O} I am {F}. I will be {F} {T} too. Leave it there.", "react|*|p|{O} I owe you one {T}. Remind me if I forget, which I will not.", "react|*|p|{A+:cap}. {ME} will hear about it from me, the good way.", "react|*|p|That {=helped/landed/mattered}. {X} will not say it, so I will.", "opinion|statefed|p|The governor of {ME} called me {T} about the {=mandate/standard/grant}. For once we agree. Write that down.", "opinion|statefed|n|{O} every {=mandate/preemption/rule} we pass lands on a {=county clerk/school board/sheriff} who never voted for it. {A-:cap}.", "opinion|statefed|z|{O} the states were here first. The federal office was the states' idea. People forget the order of things.", "opinion|statefed|z|The {=state house/governor's office/attorney general} in {ME} has a {A} lawyer on this already. We will be in court {T}.", "opinion|immigration|z|{O} the people on the {=waiting list/visa line/hearing docket} in {ME} have names. I keep a {=list/file/folder} of them.", "opinion|immigration|n|{WHO:cap} has never {=stood in a visa line/read a hearing docket/met a seasonal crew}. It shows in the {PART}.", "opinion|foreign|z|{O} the {=envoy/ambassador/trade delegation} from the realms was in {P} {T}. {A:cap} visit. Very polite. Very long.", "opinion|foreign|p|A {A+} {=treaty/aid line/trade deal} is the cheapest friend you will ever buy. Ask {ME}'s {=harbour/farms/mills}."];
  const BANK = {};
  for(const k in LEX) BANK[k] = LEX[k].split("|");
  const TPL = TPL_RAW.map(r => { const a = r.split("|"); return {i:a[0], t:a[1], s:a[2], x:a.slice(3).join("|")}; });
  /* order-2 chains per intent, over template tokens (slots stay slots) */
  const CH = {};
  TPL.forEach(t => {
    const toks = ["^", "^"].concat(t.x.split(" ")).concat(["$"]);
    const c = CH[t.i] || (CH[t.i] = {});
    for(let i = 2; i < toks.length; i++){
      const key = toks[i-2] + " " + toks[i-1];
      (c[key] || (c[key] = [])).push(toks[i]);
    }
  });
  const SLOT = {
    DOC:"bill|amendment|rider|substitute|conference report|manager's amendment|committee print|chairman's mark|base text|appropriation|authorization|motion".split("|"),
    PART:"section|clause|sunset clause|definitions section|savings clause|effective date|offset|carve-out|reporting requirement|waiver|enacting clause|fiscal note|severability clause".split("|"),
    FAM:"wife|husband|daughter|son|mother|father|sister|brother|grandmother|grandfather|aunt|uncle|niece|nephew|godson|goddaughter".split("|"),
    FEV:"birthday|recital|ballgame|school play|christening|graduation|anniversary|first communion|county fair ribbon".split("|")
  };
  const CULT_OPEN = {dutch:"dutch", yankee:"yankee", midlands:"midlands", prairie:"prairie", delta:"delta", highplains:"highplains", mountain:"mountain", pacific:"pacific"};
  const lexCount = Object.keys(BANK).reduce((s, k) => s + BANK[k].length, 0);
  function rnd(){ return Math.random(); }
  function pickFrom(arr){ return arr[(rnd() * arr.length) | 0]; }
  function idio(m){
    if(!m) return {p:{}, reg:"plain"};
    if(!m.idio || !m.idio.p){
      const tr = m.traits || {};
      const reg = (m.creed === "latin" || m.creed === "consul") && chance(0.35) ? "latin" : ((tr.vanity || 50) > 64 || (tr.discretion || 50) > 72 ? "formal" : "plain");
      m.idio = {p:{}, reg, n:0, last:[]};
    }
    return m.idio;
  }
  function choose(m, list){
    if(!list || !list.length) return "";
    const I = idio(m);
    /* idiolect: a speaker's favourites come back more, with a slow drift */
    let tot = 0; const w = new Array(list.length);
    for(let i = 0; i < list.length; i++){ w[i] = 1 + (I.p[list[i]] || 0); tot += w[i]; }
    let r = rnd() * tot, k = 0;
    for(; k < list.length; k++){ r -= w[k]; if(r <= 0) break; }
    const word = list[Math.min(k, list.length - 1)];
    I.p[word] = Math.min(6, (I.p[word] || 0) + 0.6);
    const keys = Object.keys(I.p);
    if(keys.length > 48){ keys.sort((a, b) => I.p[a] - I.p[b]); for(let i = 0; i < keys.length - 40; i++) delete I.p[keys[i]]; }
    return word;
  }
  function bank(pos, topic, sent){
    const s = sent > 0 ? "p" : sent < 0 ? "n" : "z";
    return BANK[pos + ":" + topic + ":" + s] || BANK[pos + ":" + topic + ":z"] || BANK[pos + ":any:" + s] || BANK[pos + ":any:z"] || [];
  }
  function plural(w){
    if(/ /.test(w)){ const i = w.lastIndexOf(" "); return w.slice(0, i + 1) + plural(w.slice(i + 1)); }
    if(/^[A-Z]/.test(w)) return w;
    if(/(s|x|z|ch|sh)$/.test(w)) return w + "es";
    if(/[^aeiou]y$/.test(w)) return w.slice(0, -1) + "ies";
    return w + "s";
  }
  function third(v){
    const i = v.indexOf(" "), b = i < 0 ? v : v.slice(0, i), rest = i < 0 ? "" : v.slice(i);
    if(/(s|x|z|ch|sh|o)$/.test(b)) return b + "es" + rest;
    if(/[^aeiou]y$/.test(b)) return b.slice(0, -1) + "ies" + rest;
    return b + "s" + rest;
  }
  function ing(v){
    const i = v.indexOf(" "), b = i < 0 ? v : v.slice(0, i), rest = i < 0 ? "" : v.slice(i);
    let o;
    if(/ie$/.test(b)) o = b.slice(0, -2) + "ying";
    else if(/[^e]e$/.test(b)) o = b.slice(0, -1) + "ing";
    else o = b + "ing";
    return o + rest;
  }
  const cap = s => s ? s.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + s.slice(1) : s;
  /* canon guards: run on every composed line */
  const BAD = [
    /taylor[^.]{0,40}\b(god|lord|almighty|divine|deity|messiah|saviou?r|worship)/i,
    /\b(god|lord|almighty|divine|deity|messiah)[^.]{0,40}taylor/i,
    /\b(like|as great as|greater than|the next|another|a new)\s+(the first consul|taylor)/i,
    /\bdominic\b|\bzachary\b/i,
    /\bhymn\b|7\s*\/\s*7|seven\s*[-\/ ]\s*seven/i,
    /\bconsul\b[^.]{0,30}\bis god\b/i
  ];
  function guard(s){
    if(!s) return null;
    for(const r of BAD) if(r.test(s)) return null;
    return s;
  }
  function topicFor(m, ctx){
    if(ctx && ctx.topic) return ctx.topic;
    try{
      const s = m.sent; const t = s && s.topic;
      if(t === "faith" || t === "creed") return "faith";
      if(t === "money") return "money";
      if(t === "bill" || t === "vote") return "bills";
    }catch(e){}
    const b = G.bill;
    if(b && !b.done && chance(0.5)){
      const k = b.kind || "";
      if(/immig/.test(k)) return "immigration";
      if(/foreign|aid/.test(k)) return "foreign";
      if(/state/.test(k)) return "statefed";
      return "bills";
    }
    return pickFrom(["bills", "district", "house", "money", "immigration", "foreign", "statefed"]);
  }
  function fill(x, m, ctx, topic, sent){
    const st = (G.states || []).find(s => s.n === m.state);
    const cult = st && st.cult;
    const I = idio(m);
    const others = (G.members || []).filter(o => o && o !== m && !o.gone && o.kind === "member" && !o.machine);
    const X = others.length ? pickFrom(others) : null;
    const X2 = others.length > 1 ? pickFrom(others.filter(o => o !== X)) : X;
    const you = G.you ? surname(G.you.name) : "friend";
    const cr = (typeof creedOf === "function") ? creedOf(m.creed) : null;
    return x.replace(/\{(=[^}:]+|[A-Za-z0-9+\-]+)(:cap)?\}/g, (all, k, c) => {
      let w = "";
      if(k.charAt(0) === "="){ w = choose(m, k.slice(1).split("/")); return c ? cap(w) : w; }
      if(k === "O"){
        const regList = BANK["open:" + I.reg + ":z"] || BANK["open:plain:z"];
        const dia = cult && CULT_OPEN[cult] && chance(0.4) ? BANK["open:" + CULT_OPEN[cult] + ":z"] : null;
        w = choose(m, dia || regList);
        if(chance(0.25)) w = "";
      }
      else if(k === "C") w = choose(m, BANK["close:" + (topic === "faith" ? "faith" : I.reg) + ":z"] || BANK["close:plain:z"]);
      else if(k === "N") w = choose(m, bank("n", topic, 0).concat(chance(0.2) ? bank("n", "any", 0).slice(0, 60) : []));
      else if(k === "Ns") w = plural(choose(m, bank("n", topic, 0)));
      else if(k === "Na") w = choose(m, bank("n", "any", 0));
      else if(k === "Nas") w = plural(choose(m, bank("n", "any", 0)));
      else if(k === "DOC") w = choose(m, SLOT.DOC);
      else if(k === "PART") w = choose(m, SLOT.PART);
      else if(k === "DIST") w = choose(m, bank("n", "district", 0));
      else if(k === "FAM") w = choose(m, SLOT.FAM);
      else if(k === "FEV") w = choose(m, SLOT.FEV);
      else if(k === "A+") w = choose(m, bank("a", "any", 1));
      else if(k === "A-") w = choose(m, bank("a", "any", -1));
      else if(k === "A0") w = choose(m, bank("a", "any", 0));
      else if(k === "A") w = choose(m, bank("a", "anomaly", 0));
      else if(k === "V") w = choose(m, bank("v", topic, 0).length ? bank("v", topic, 0) : bank("v", "any", 0));
      else if(k === "Vs") w = third(choose(m, bank("v", topic, 0).length ? bank("v", topic, 0) : bank("v", "any", 0)));
      else if(k === "Vany") w = choose(m, bank("v", "any", 0));
      else if(k === "R") w = choose(m, bank("r", "any", 0));
      else if(k === "WHO") w = choose(m, BANK["who:any:z"]);
      else if(k === "T") w = choose(m, BANK["time:any:z"]);
      else if(k === "F") w = choose(m, bank("feel", "any", sent));
      else if(k === "P") w = choose(m, BANK["place:any:z"]);
      else if(k === "ME") w = m.state || "the district";
      else if(k === "YOU") w = you;
      else if(k === "X") w = X ? surname(X.name) : "somebody";
      else if(k === "X2") w = X2 ? surname(X2.name) : "somebody else";
      else if(k === "CR") w = cr ? cr.adj : "Latin";
      else if(k === "CRC") w = cr ? cr.adj : "Latin";
      else if(k === "BILL") w = (G.bill && G.bill.title) || "the bill";
