    '<div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">By temper you would ' + (W.boast > 55 ? "rather be seen spending" : W.boast < 30 ? "rather nobody knew" : "go either way") + ', and you ' + (W.thrift > 60 ? "keep a tight hand on a coin" : "do not mind spending") + '. Your time is your own too: nobody can spend it for you.</div>' +
